anentrypoint-design kit Btn (src/components/shell.js) renders <a href="#" role=button> and its onclick does NOT call preventDefault. Any consumer using Btn for actions inside a page that relies on the URL hash (e.g. fsbrowse's #/path history routing) must wrap onClick to e.preventDefault(), else each click appends '#' and clobbers the hash. fsbrowse uses a guard(fn) helper for this.